{"id":"harnessGuide:armbinders-for-everyone-diamond-harness","loc":"/harness-guides/armbinders-for-everyone-diamond-harness","title":"Armbinders for Everyone: Diamond Harness","level":"Level 2 | Intermediate","subtitle":"Follow step-by-step illustrated instructions","tags_line":"Upper body · Armbinders","about":"An armbinder that gathers the arms behind the back in a repeating diamond pattern. It starts with a double column tie at the wrists and stacks hojo cuffs up the forearms and upper arms. A munter hitch forms a diamond wherever the lines cross, and a reinforcing pass back up the stem sets the pattern and tension.","guide_url":"https://heyzine.com/flip-book/5dca2ced52.html","image_urls":["https://www.gravatar.com/avatar/63cc0e024aafede6a008a9a6661b4877?d=https%3A%2F%2Fui-avatars.com%2Fapi%2FWS%2F200%2FFFF2E9%2Ffaa96d%2F2%2F0.44","https://shibaristudy.com/_next/image?url=%2Fnext%2Fassets%2Fharness-guides%2Farmbinders-for-everyone-thick-stem-pattern.webp&w=384&q=75","https://shibaristudy.com/_next/image?url=%2Fnext%2Fassets%2Fharness-guides%2Fbutterfly-harness.webp&w=384&q=75","https://shibaristudy.com/_next/image?url=%2Fnext%2Fassets%2Fharness-guides%2Ffisherman-harness.webp&w=384&q=75","https://shibaristudy.com/_next/image?url=%2Fnext%2Fassets%2Fharness-guides%2Flavender-harness.webp&w=384&q=75","https://shibaristudy.com/_next/image?url=%2Fnext%2Fassets%2Fharness-guides%2Fless-is-more-belly-hug.webp&w=384&q=75","/_next/image?url=%2Fnext%2Fassets%2Fharness-guides%2Fless-is-more-tengu.webp&w=2560&q=75","/_next/image?url=%2Fnext%2Fassets%2Fharness-guides%2Ftams-tengu-harness.webp&w=2560&q=75"],"downloaded_files":["./harness_guides/Armbinders_for_Everyone_Diamond_Harness/01.jpg","./harness_guides/Armbinders_for_Everyone_Diamond_Harness/02.jpg","./harness_guides/Armbinders_for_Everyone_Diamond_Harness/03.jpg","./harness_guides/Armbinders_for_Everyone_Diamond_Harness/04.jpg","./harness_guides/Armbinders_for_Everyone_Diamond_Harness/05.jpg","./harness_guides/Armbinders_for_Everyone_Diamond_Harness/06.jpg","./harness_guides/Armbinders_for_Everyone_Diamond_Harness/07.jpg","./harness_guides/Armbinders_for_Everyone_Diamond_Harness/08.jpg"]}
{"id":"harnessGuide:armbinders-for-everyone-thick-stem-pattern","loc":"/harness-guides/armbinders-for-everyone-thick-stem-pattern","title":"Armbinders for Everyone: Thick Stem Pattern","level":"Level 2 | Intermediate","subtitle":"Follow step-by-step illustrated instructions","tags_line":"Upper body · Armbinders","about":"The second armbinder in the series uses a thick central stem instead of a surface pattern. It starts with a double column tie at the wrists and a top wrap around the shoulders and torso shaped with reverse tension. Cuffs above and below the elbow lock into the stem with half moon and L frictions, shifting the structure from the arms to the stem.","guide_url":"https://heyzine.com/flip-book/a6ed32e306.html","image_urls":["https://www.gravatar.com/avatar/63cc0e024aafede6a008a9a6661b4877?d=https%3A%2F%2Fui-avatars.com%2Fapi%2FWS%2F200%2FFFF2E9%2Ffaa96d%2F2%2F0.44","https://shibaristudy.com/_next/image?url=%2Fnext%2Fassets%2Fharness-guides%2Farmbinders-for-everyone-diamond-harness.webp&w=384&q=75","https://shibaristudy.com/_next/image?url=%2Fnext%2Fassets%2Fharness-guides%2Fbutterfly-harness.webp&w=384&q=75","https://shibaristudy.com/_next/image?url=%2Fnext%2Fassets%2Fharness-guides%2Ffisherman-harness.webp&w=384&q=75","https://shibaristudy.com/_next/image?url=%2Fnext%2Fassets%2Fharness-guides%2Flavender-harness.webp&w=384&q=75","https://shibaristudy.com/_next/image?url=%2Fnext%2Fassets%2Fharness-guides%2Fless-is-more-belly-hug.webp&w=384&q=75","/_next/image?url=%2Fnext%2Fassets%2Fharness-guides%2Fless-is-more-tengu.webp&w=2560&q=75","/_next/image?url=%2Fnext%2Fassets%2Fharness-guides%2Ftams-tengu-harness.webp&w=2560&q=75"],"downloaded_files":["./harness_guides/Armbinders_for_Everyone_Thick_Stem_Pattern/01.jpg","./harness_guides/Armbinders_for_Everyone_Thick_Stem_Pattern/02.jpg","./harness_guides/Armbinders_for_Everyone_Thick_Stem_Pattern/03.jpg","./harness_guides/Armbinders_for_Everyone_Thick_Stem_Pattern/04.jpg","./harness_guides/Armbinders_for_Everyon