{"id":"harnessGuide:butterfly-harness","loc":"/harness-guides/butterfly-harness","title":"Butterfly Harness","level":"Level 2 | Intermediate","subtitle":"Follow step-by-step illustrated instructions","tags_line":"Upper body · Arms free","about":"An arms-free chest harness built from two diagonals that cross at the front of the body. The shoulder straps are set with a loose larkshead, traced back on themselves, and locked into a waist cuff and reinforced stem down the back. A cuff on each hip connects the chest harness to the lower body.","guide_url":"https://heyzine.com/flip-book/0f506e3b07.html","image_urls":["https://www.gravatar.com/avatar/63cc0e024aafede6a008a9a6661b4877?d=https%3A%2F%2Fui-avatars.com%2Fapi%2FWS%2F200%2FFFF2E9%2Ffaa96d%2F2%2F0.44","https://shibaristudy.com/_next/image?url=%2Fnext%2Fapi%2Fuscreen-assets%2Fprograms%2Fimages%2Fprograms%2F253185%2Fhorizontal%2F6e0203db-fa48-4202-838b-0b56e4c8f6fb.png&w=384&q=75","https://shibaristudy.com/next/api/uscreen-assets/programs/images/author/7871/small_small_small_Gorgone-PORTRAIT.1636072101.jpeg","https://shibaristudy.com/_next/image?url=%2Fnext%2Fapi%2Fuscreen-assets%2Fprograms%2Fimages%2Fprograms%2F1905894%2Fhorizontal%2Fself-butterfly-thumbnail.1665534218.jpg&w=384&q=75","https://shibaristudy.com/next/api/uscreen-assets/programs/images/author/37643/small_photo-04-10-2021-9-45-00-pm.1678974613.jpg","https://shibaristudy.com/_next/image?url=%2Fnext%2Fapi%2Fuscreen-assets%2Fprograms%2Fimages%2Fprograms%2F4446472%2Fhorizontal%2Fd5777351-97db-4c46-b910-bfde0e3fa1bc.png&w=384&q=75","https://shibaristudy.com/next/api/uscreen-assets/programs/images/author/128098/small_cleanshot-2026-10-04-at-1927182x.1791156453.png","https://shibaristudy.com/_next/image?url=%2Fnext%2Fassets%2Fblog%2Fcms%2Fweb-harness-purple-background.webp&w=384&q=75","https://shibaristudy.com/next/assets/blog/cms/author-shibari-study-team.webp","https://shibaristudy.com/_next/image?url=%2Fnext%2Fassets%2Fblog%2Fcms%2Farms-free-chest-harness.we