{"id":"harnessGuide:first-flight-futomomo","loc":"/harness-guides/first-flight-futomomo","title":"First Flight Futomomo","level":"Level 2 | Intermediate","subtitle":"Follow step-by-step illustrated instructions","tags_line":"Lower body · Futomomo","about":"A futomomo that folds the calf against the thigh and binds them together. It starts with a single column tie at the ankle and uses forward tension around the leg, locking each wrap before adding the next. The top wrap finishes like a hojo cuff, and the stem runs back down the leg. The full tie uses only a handful of wraps.","guide_url":"https://heyzine.com/flip-book/045af74591.html","image_urls":["https://www.gravatar.com/avatar/63cc0e024aafede6a008a9a6661b4877?d=https%3A%2F%2Fui-avatars.com%2Fapi%2FWS%2F200%2FFFF2E9%2Ffaa96d%2F2%2F0.44","https://shibaristudy.com/_next/image?url=%2Fnext%2Fapi%2Fuscreen-assets%2Fprograms%2Fimages%2Fprograms%2F3914570%2Fhorizontal%2F59f084c8-6231-4845-bdb3-c2d3a347f6be.png&w=384&q=75","https://shibaristudy.com/next/api/uscreen-assets/programs/images/author/9951/small_small_Untitled_design.1646940390.png","https://shibaristudy.com/_next/image?url=%2Fnext%2Fassets%2Fharness-guides%2Fgorgones-hip-harness.webp&w=384&q=75","https://shibaristudy.com/_next/image?url=%2Fnext%2Fassets%2Fharness-guides%2Fhip-cuffs-harness.webp&w=384&q=75","https://shibaristudy.com/_next/image?url=%2Fnext%2Fassets%2Fharness-guides%2Fliefs-booty-basket.webp&w=384&q=75","https://shibaristudy.com/_next/image?url=%2Fnext%2Fassets%2Fharness-guides%2Farmbinders-for-everyone-diamond-harness.webp&w=384&q=75","https://shibaristudy.com/_next/image?url=%2Fnext%2Fassets%2Fharness-guides%2Farmbinders-for-everyone-thick-stem-pattern.webp&w=384&q=75","/_next/image?url=%2Fnext%2Fassets%2Fharness-guides%2Fbutterfly-harness.webp&w=2560&q=75","https://shibaristudy.com/_next/image?url=%2Fnext%2Fassets%2Fharness-guides%2Ffisherman-harness.webp&w=384&q=75"],"downloaded_files":["./harness_guides/First_Flight_Futomomo/01.jpg","./harn