{"id":"harnessGuide:fisherman-harness","loc":"/harness-guides/fisherman-harness","title":"Fisherman Harness","level":"Level 2 | Intermediate","subtitle":"Follow step-by-step illustrated instructions","tags_line":"Upper body · Non-TK","about":"A non-TK harness that wraps up the torso from the waist and holds the elbows against the body. Munter hitches connect three to five wraps down the front and back. The guide shows the completed harness, followed by an optional arm and shoulder line for side-suspension support.","guide_url":"https://heyzine.com/flip-book/3ca6401c22.html","image_urls":["https://www.gravatar.com/avatar/63cc0e024aafede6a008a9a6661b4877?d=https%3A%2F%2Fui-avatars.com%2Fapi%2FWS%2F200%2FFFF2E9%2Ffaa96d%2F2%2F0.44","https://shibaristudy.com/_next/image?url=%2Fnext%2Fapi%2Fuscreen-assets%2Fprograms%2Fimages%2Fprograms%2F267399%2Fhorizontal%2F7900_2Fcatalog_image_2F267399_2FU5Y2022RRAqgM2SqR9LN_fisherman-thumbnail.jpg&w=384&q=75","https://shibaristudy.com/next/api/uscreen-assets/programs/images/author/7871/small_small_small_Gorgone-PORTRAIT.1636072101.jpeg","https://shibaristudy.com/_next/image?url=%2Fnext%2Fassets%2Fharness-guides%2Flavender-harness.webp&w=384&q=75","https://shibaristudy.com/_next/image?url=%2Fnext%2Fassets%2Fharness-guides%2Fless-is-more-belly-hug.webp&w=384&q=75","https://shibaristudy.com/_next/image?url=%2Fnext%2Fassets%2Fharness-guides%2Fless-is-more-tengu.webp&w=384&q=75","https://shibaristudy.com/_next/image?url=%2Fnext%2Fassets%2Fharness-guides%2Ftams-tengu-harness.webp&w=384&q=75","https://shibaristudy.com/_next/image?url=%2Fnext%2Fassets%2Fharness-guides%2Ftenshi-harness.webp&w=384&q=75","https://shibaristudy.com/_next/image?url=%2Fnext%2Fassets%2Fharness-guides%2Farmbinders-for-everyone-diamond-harness.webp&w=384&q=75","https://shibaristudy.com/_next/image?url=%2Fnext%2Fassets%2Fharness-guides%2Farmbinders-for-everyone-thick-stem-pattern.webp&w=384&q=75"],"downloaded_files":["./harness_guides/Fisherman_Harness/01.jpg","./harne