{"id":"harnessGuide:gorgones-hip-harness","loc":"/harness-guides/gorgones-hip-harness","title":"Gorgone's Hip Harness","level":"Level 2 | Intermediate","subtitle":"Follow step-by-step illustrated instructions","tags_line":"Lower body · Hip harness","about":"A hip harness that connects a waist line to a cuff on each thigh. X frictions lock the thigh cuffs, and a load-bearing stem runs down the back. The hip lines weave over and under each other where they meet. An optional final pass joins the waist line to the stem before the lock-off.","guide_url":"https://heyzine.com/flip-book/a9844c5048.html","image_urls":["https://www.gravatar.com/avatar/63cc0e024aafede6a008a9a6661b4877?d=https%3A%2F%2Fui-avatars.com%2Fapi%2FWS%2F200%2FFFF2E9%2Ffaa96d%2F2%2F0.44","https://shibaristudy.com/_next/image?url=%2Fnext%2Fapi%2Fuscreen-assets%2Fprograms%2Fimages%2Fprograms%2F253222%2Fhorizontal%2F7900_2Fcatalog_image_2F253222_2Fpih1KGFgSj2pOdGqmZrm_Screenshot_202019-12-30_20at_2011.28.36.png&w=384&q=75","https://shibaristudy.com/next/api/uscreen-assets/programs/images/author/7871/small_small_small_Gorgone-PORTRAIT.1636072101.jpeg","https://shibaristudy.com/_next/image?url=%2Fnext%2Fassets%2Fharness-guides%2Fhip-cuffs-harness.webp&w=384&q=75","https://shibaristudy.com/_next/image?url=%2Fnext%2Fassets%2Fharness-guides%2Fliefs-booty-basket.webp&w=384&q=75","https://shibaristudy.com/_next/image?url=%2Fnext%2Fassets%2Fharness-guides%2Ffirst-flight-futomomo.webp&w=384&q=75","https://shibaristudy.com/_next/image?url=%2Fnext%2Fassets%2Fharness-guides%2Farmbinders-for-everyone-diamond-harness.webp&w=384&q=75","https://shibaristudy.com/_next/image?url=%2Fnext%2Fassets%2Fharness-guides%2Farmbinders-for-everyone-thick-stem-pattern.webp&w=384&q=75","/_next/image?url=%2Fnext%2Fassets%2Fharness-guides%2Fbutterfly-harness.webp&w=2560&q=75","/_next/image?url=%2Fnext%2Fassets%2Fharness-guides%2Ffisherman-harness.webp&w=2560&q=75"],"downloaded_files":["./harness_guides/Gorgones_Hip_Harness/01.jpg","./harn