{"id":"harnessGuide:hip-cuffs-harness","loc":"/harness-guides/hip-cuffs-harness","title":"Hip Cuffs Harness","level":null,"subtitle":"Harness Guide","tags_line":"Follow step-by-step illustrated instructions","about":"A minimal tie that binds each wrist to the thigh on the same side. A double column tie joins the thigh and wrist, a munter hitch locks it at the front of the body, and a cinch runs between the inside of the wrist and the hip. It uses one rope per side and does not cross the torso.","guide_url":"https://heyzine.com/flip-book/9055f4041c.html","image_urls":["https://www.gravatar.com/avatar/63cc0e024aafede6a008a9a6661b4877?d=https%3A%2F%2Fui-avatars.com%2Fapi%2FWS%2F200%2FFFF2E9%2Ffaa96d%2F2%2F0.44","https://shibaristudy.com/_next/image?url=%2Fnext%2Fassets%2Fharness-guides%2Fgorgones-hip-harness.webp&w=384&q=75","https://shibaristudy.com/_next/image?url=%2Fnext%2Fassets%2Fharness-guides%2Fliefs-booty-basket.webp&w=384&q=75","https://shibaristudy.com/_next/image?url=%2Fnext%2Fassets%2Fharness-guides%2Ffirst-flight-futomomo.webp&w=384&q=75","https://shibaristudy.com/_next/image?url=%2Fnext%2Fassets%2Fharness-guides%2Farmbinders-for-everyone-diamond-harness.webp&w=384&q=75","https://shibaristudy.com/_next/image?url=%2Fnext%2Fassets%2Fharness-guides%2Farmbinders-for-everyone-thick-stem-pattern.webp&w=384&q=75","/_next/image?url=%2Fnext%2Fassets%2Fharness-guides%2Fbutterfly-harness.webp&w=2560&q=75","/_next/image?url=%2Fnext%2Fassets%2Fharness-guides%2Ffisherman-harness.webp&w=2560&q=75"],"downloaded_files":["./harness_guides/Hip_Cuffs_Harness/01.jpg","./harness_guides/Hip_Cuffs_Harness/02.jpg","./harness_guides/Hip_Cuffs_Harness/03.jpg","./harness_guides/Hip_Cuffs_Harness/04.jpg","./harness_guides/Hip_Cuffs_Harness/05.jpg","./harness_guides/Hip_Cuffs_Harness/06.jpg","./harness_guides/Hip_Cuffs_Harness/07.jpg","./harness_guides/Hip_Cuffs_Harness/08.jpg"]}
{"id":"harnessGuide:lavender-harness","loc":"/harness-guides/lavender-harness","title":"Lavender Harness","level":"Level 2 | Intermediate","subtitle":"Follow step-by-step illustrated instructions","tags_line":"Upper body · Non-TK","about":"A short non-TK harness that holds both arms together behind the back. A double column tie binds the arms. A single wrap made with reverse tension then gathers the arms and chest and locks with an X friction. The running line passes under the original tie to the front of the body and finishes with a half hitch on the top wrap.","guide_url":"https://heyzine.com/flip-book/a5f73f9e20.html","image_urls":["https://www.gravatar.com/avatar/63cc0e024aafede6a008a9a6661b4877?d=https%3A%2F%2Fui-avatars.com%2Fapi%2FWS%2F200%2FFFF2E9%2Ffaa96d%2F2%2F0.44","https://shibaristudy.com/_next/image?url=%2Fnext%2Fapi%2Fuscreen-assets%2Fprograms%2Fimages%2Fprograms%2F4079214%2Fhorizontal%2Fd39abc57-66bb-466d-87f5-9b1f990c9452.png&w=384&q=75","https://shibaristudy.com/next/api/uscreen-assets/programs/images/author/105715/small_ms-reemah-3.1793961793.png","https://shibaristudy.com/_next/image?url=%2Fnext%2Fassets%2Fharness-guides%2Ffisherman-harness.webp&w=384&q=75","https://shibaristudy.com/_next/image?url=%2Fnext%2Fassets%2Fharness-guides%2Fless-is-more-belly-hug.webp&w=384&q=75","https://shibaristudy.com/_next/image?url=%2Fnext%2Fassets%2Fharness-guides%2Fless-is-more-tengu.webp&w=384&q=75","https://shibaristudy.com/_next/image?url=%2Fnext%2Fassets%2Fharness-guides%2Ftams-tengu-harness.webp&w=384&q=75","https://shibaristudy.com/_next/image?url=%2Fnext%2Fassets%2Fharness-guides%2Ftenshi-harness.webp&w=384&q=75","https://shibaristudy.com/_next/image?url=%2Fnext%2Fassets%2Fharness-guides%2Farmbinders-for-everyone-diamond-harness.webp&w=384&q=75","https://shibaristudy.com/_next/image?url=%2Fnext%2Fassets%2Fharness-guides%2Farmbinders-for-everyone-thick-stem-pattern.webp&w=384&q=75"],"downloaded_files":["./harness_guides/Lavender_Harness/01.jpg","./harness_