{"id":"harnessGuide:less-is-more-belly-hug","loc":"/harness-guides/less-is-more-belly-hug","title":"Less is More: Belly Hug","level":"Level 1 | Beginner","subtitle":"Follow step-by-step illustrated instructions","tags_line":"Upper body · Non-TK","about":"A minimal non-TK tie that holds both hands across the waist. It starts with a single column tie on one wrist, wraps across the waist to secure the second hand, and reverses on the bight to add a second layer. Full turns at the back gather the lines before a final half hitch.","guide_url":"https://heyzine.com/flip-book/ea4226f862.html","image_urls":["https://www.gravatar.com/avatar/63cc0e024aafede6a008a9a6661b4877?d=https%3A%2F%2Fui-avatars.com%2Fapi%2FWS%2F200%2FFFF2E9%2Ffaa96d%2F2%2F0.44","https://shibaristudy.com/_next/image?url=%2Fnext%2Fassets%2Fharness-guides%2Ffisherman-harness.webp&w=384&q=75","/_next/image?url=%2Fnext%2Fassets%2Fharness-guides%2Flavender-harness.webp&w=2560&q=75","https://shibaristudy.com/_next/image?url=%2Fnext%2Fassets%2Fharness-guides%2Fless-is-more-tengu.webp&w=384&q=75","https://shibaristudy.com/_next/image?url=%2Fnext%2Fassets%2Fharness-guides%2Ftams-tengu-harness.webp&w=384&q=75","https://shibaristudy.com/_next/image?url=%2Fnext%2Fassets%2Fharness-guides%2Ftenshi-harness.webp&w=384&q=75","https://shibaristudy.com/_next/image?url=%2Fnext%2Fassets%2Fharness-guides%2Farmbinders-for-everyone-diamond-harness.webp&w=384&q=75","https://shibaristudy.com/_next/image?url=%2Fnext%2Fassets%2Fharness-guides%2Farmbinders-for-everyone-thick-stem-pattern.webp&w=384&q=75"],"downloaded_files":["./harness_guides/Less_is_More_Belly_Hug/01.jpg","./harness_guides/Less_is_More_Belly_Hug/02.jpg","./harness_guides/Less_is_More_Belly_Hug/03.jpg","./harness_guides/Less_is_More_Belly_Hug/04.jpg","./harness_guides/Less_is_More_Belly_Hug/05.jpg","./harness_guides/Less_is_More_Belly_Hug/06.jpg","./harness_guides/Less_is_More_Belly_Hug/07.jpg","./harness_guides/Less_is_More_Belly_Hug/08.jpg"]}
{"id":"harnessGuide:less-is-more-tengu","loc":"/harness-guides/less-is-more-tengu","title":"Less is More: Tengu","level":"Level 1 | Beginner","subtitle":"Follow step-by-step illustrated instructions","tags_line":"Upper body · Non-TK","about":"A pared-back tengu that holds both wrists at the waist and adds a cuff at each elbow. The wrists are bound with a single-wrap single column tie. A half hitch at the middle of the back forms a horizontal stem for the rest of the harness. Single-wrap hojo cuffs at the elbows and waist return to the stem and form a diamond across the back.","guide_url":"https://heyzine.com/flip-book/120909b4fc.html","image_urls":["https://www.gravatar.com/avatar/63cc0e024aafede6a008a9a6661b4877?d=https%3A%2F%2Fui-avatars.com%2Fapi%2FWS%2F200%2FFFF2E9%2Ffaa96d%2F2%2F0.44","https://shibaristudy.com/_next/image?url=%2Fnext%2Fassets%2Fharness-guides%2Ffisherman-harness.webp&w=384&q=75","/_next/image?url=%2Fnext%2Fassets%2Fharness-guides%2Flavender-harness.webp&w=2560&q=75","/_next/image?url=%2Fnext%2Fassets%2Fharness-guides%2Fless-is-more-belly-hug.webp&w=2560&q=75","https://shibaristudy.com/_next/image?url=%2Fnext%2Fassets%2Fharness-guides%2Ftams-tengu-harness.webp&w=384&q=75","https://shibaristudy.com/_next/image?url=%2Fnext%2Fassets%2Fharness-guides%2Ftenshi-harness.webp&w=384&q=75","https://shibaristudy.com/_next/image?url=%2Fnext%2Fassets%2Fharness-guides%2Farmbinders-for-everyone-diamond-harness.webp&w=384&q=75","https://shibaristudy.com/_next/image?url=%2Fnext%2Fassets%2Fharness-guides%2Farmbinders-for-everyone-thick-stem-pattern.webp&w=384&q=75"],"downloaded_files":["./harness_guides/Less_is_More_Tengu/01.jpg","./harness_guides/Less_is_More_Tengu/02.jpg","./harness_guides/Less_is_More_Tengu/03.jpg","./harness_guides/Less_is_More_Tengu/04.jpg","./harness_guides/Less_is_More_Tengu/05.jpg","./harness_guides/Less_is_More_Tengu/06.jpg","./harness_guides/Less_is_More_Tengu/07.jpg","./harness_guides/Less_is_More_Tengu/08.jpg"]}
{"id":"harnessGuide:liefs-booty-basket","loc":"/harness-guides/liefs-booty-basket","title":"Lief's Booty Basket","level":"Level 2 | Intermediate","subtitle":"Follow step-by-step illustrated instructions","tags_line":"Lower body · Hip harness","about":"A hip harness that supports the seat and belly with one continuous rope. A large larkshead starts the waist tie, followed by three body wraps made with reverse tensions. Cinching between the belly and the tops of the thighs turns the waist tie into a double column with a seatbelt across the front. A final cinch runs between the legs.","guide_url":"https://heyzine.com/flip-book/f4a5e87e39.html","image_urls":["https://www.gravatar.com/avatar/63cc0e024aafede6a008a9a6661b4877?d=https%3A%2F%2Fui-avatars.com%2Fapi%2FWS%2F200%2FFFF2E9%2Ffaa96d%2F2%2F0.44","https://shibaristudy.com/_next/image?url=%2Fnext%2Fassets%2Fharness-guides%2Fgorgones-hip-harness.webp&w=384&q=75","https://shibaristudy.com/_next/image?url=%2Fnext%2Fassets%2Fharness-guides%2Fhip-cuffs-harness.webp&w=384&q=75","https://shibaristudy.com/_next/image?url=%2Fnext%2Fassets%2Fharness-guides%2Ffirst-flight-futomomo.webp&w=384&q=75","https://shibaristudy.com/_next/image?url=%2Fnext%2Fassets%2Fharness-guides%2Farmbinders-for-everyone-diamond-harness.webp&w=384&q=75","https://shibaristudy.com/_next/image?url=%2Fnext%2Fassets%2Fharness-guides%2Farmbinders-for-everyone-thick-stem-pattern.webp&w=384&q=75","/_next/image?url=%2Fnext%2Fassets%2Fharness-guides%2Fbutterfly-harness.webp&w=2560&q=75","https://shibaristudy.com/_next/image?url=%2Fnext%2Fassets%2Fharness-guides%2Ffisherman-harness.webp&w=384&q=75"],"downloaded_files":["./harness_guides/Liefs_Booty_Basket/01.jpg","./harness_guides/Liefs_Booty_Basket/02.jpg","./harness_guides/Liefs_Booty_Basket/03.jpg","./harness_guides/Liefs_Booty_Basket/04.jpg","./harness_guides/Liefs_Booty_Basket/05.jpg","./harness_guides/Liefs_Booty_Basket/06.jpg","./harness_guides/Liefs_Booty_Basket/07.jpg","./harness_guides/Liefs_Booty_Basket/08.jpg"]}
{"id":"harnessGuide:tams-tengu-harness","loc":"/harness-guides/tams-tengu-harness","title":"Tam's Tengu Harness","level":"Level 2 | Intermediate","subtitle":"Follow step-by-step illustrated instructions","tags_line":"Upper body · Non-TK","about":"A non-TK harness that binds the upper arms under two chest wraps. Cuffs on both biceps meet at a horizontal stem across the back. The top wrap crosses the shoulders, the lower wrap crosses the chest, and both gather into a small stem at the front. Each wrist is cuffed with the palm secured, then the wrist lines lock into the top wrap with an X friction.","guide_url":"https://heyzine.com/flip-book/4c9ca60c44.html","image_urls":["https://www.gravatar.com/avatar/63cc0e024aafede6a008a9a6661b4877?d=https%3A%2F%2Fui-avatars.com%2Fapi%2FWS%2F200%2FFFF2E9%2Ffaa96d%2F2%2F0.44","https://shibaristudy.com/_next/image?url=%2Fnext%2Fassets%2Fharness-guides%2Ffisherman-harness.webp&w=384&q=75","/_next/image?url=%2Fnext%2Fassets%2Fharness-guides%2Flavender-harness.webp&w=2560&q=75","/_next/image?url=%2Fnext%2Fassets%2Fharness-guides%2Fless-is-more-belly-hug.webp&w=2560&q=75","/_next/image?url=%2Fnext%2Fassets%2Fharness-guides%2Fless-is-more-tengu.webp&w=2560&q=75","/_next/image?url=%2Fnext%2Fassets%2Fharness-guides%2Ftenshi-harness.webp&w=2560&q=75","https://shibaristudy.com/_next/image?url=%2Fnext%2Fassets%2Fharness-guides%2Farmbinders-for-everyone-diamond-harness.webp&w=384&q=75","https://shibaristudy.com/_next/image?url=%2Fnext%2Fassets%2Fharness-guides%2Farmbinders-for-everyone-thick-stem-pattern.webp&w=384&q=75"],"downloaded_files":["./harness_guides/Tams_Tengu_Harness/01.jpg","./harness_guides/Tams_Tengu_Harness/02.jpg","./harness_guides/Tams_Tengu_Harness/03.jpg","./harness_guides/Tams_Tengu_Harness/04.jpg","./harness_guides/Tams_Tengu_Harness/05.jpg","./harness_guides/Tams_Tengu_Harness/06.jpg","./harness_guides/Tams_Tengu_Harness/07.jpg","./harness_guides/Tams_Tengu_Harness/08.jpg"]}
{"id":"harnessGuide:tenshi-harness","loc":"/harness-guides/tenshi-harness","title":"Tenshi Harness","level":"Level 3 | Experienced","subtitle":"Follow step-by-step illustrated instructions","tags_line":"Upper body · Non-TK","about":"A non-TK harness that folds each arm and ties them together behind the back. Each arm gets two sets of loose wraps locked with X frictions while the model stays muscularly neutral, then finishes in a yuki knot. The remaining lines pass through the opposite yuki knot and twist together. The guide shows a plain lock-off and a larger yuki knot that can receive a suspension line.","guide_url":"https://heyzine.com/flip-book/265a4eb12b.html","image_urls":["https://www.gravatar.com/avatar/63cc0e024aafede6a008a9a6661b4877?d=https%3A%2F%2Fui-avatars.com%2Fapi%2FWS%2F200%2FFFF2E9%2Ffaa96d%2F2%2F0.44","https://shibaristudy.com/_next/image?url=%2Fnext%2Fapi%2Fuscreen-assets%2Fprograms%2Fimages%2Fprograms%2F3572987%2Fhorizontal%2F07ecb7cd-3bdc-4edb-869b-93b443323f07.png&w=384&q=75","https://shibaristudy.com/next/api/uscreen-assets/programs/images/author/115434/small_tifereth.1745414025.png","https://shibaristudy.com/_next/image?url=%2Fnext%2Fassets%2Fharness-guides%2Ffisherman-harness.webp&w=384&q=75","https://shibaristudy.com/_next/image?url=%2Fnext%2Fassets%2Fharness-guides%2Flavender-harness.webp&w=384&q=75","https://shibaristudy.com/_next/image?url=%2Fnext%2Fassets%2Fharness-guides%2Fless-is-more-belly-hug.webp&w=384&q=75","https://shibaristudy.com/_next/image?url=%2Fnext%2Fassets%2Fharness-guides%2Fless-is-more-tengu.webp&w=384&q=75","https://shibaristudy.com/_next/image?url=%2Fnext%2Fassets%2Fharness-guides%2Ftams-tengu-harness.webp&w=384&q=75","https://shibaristudy.com/_next/image?url=%2Fnext%2Fassets%2Fharness-guides%2Farmbinders-for-everyone-diamond-harness.webp&w=384&q=75","https://shibaristudy.com/_next/image?url=%2Fnext%2Fassets%2Fharness-guides%2Farmbinders-for-everyone-thick-stem-pattern.webp&w=384&q=75"],"downloaded_files":["./harness_